of all pairs<extra><\\/extra>\",\"<b>%{label}<\\/b><br>%{value} pairs<br>%{percentRoot:.1%} of all pairs<extra><\\/extra>\",\"<b>%{label}<\\/b><br>%{value} pairs<br>%{percentRoot:.1%} of all pairs<extra><\\/extra>\"],\"type\":\"sunburst\",\"frame\":null}],\"highlight\":{\"on\":\"plotly_click\",\"persistent\":false,\"dynamic\":false,\"selectize\":false,\"opacityDim\":0.20000000000000001,\"selected\":{\"opacity\":1},\"debounce\":0},\"shinyEvents\":[\"plotly_hover\",\"plotly_click\",\"plotly_selected\",\"plotly_relayout\",\"plotly_brushed\",\"plotly_brushing\",\"plotly_clickannotation\",\"plotly_doubleclick\",\"plotly_deselect\",\"plotly_afterplot\",\"plotly_sunburstclick\"],\"base_url\":\"https://plot.ly\"},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"plotly html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-73df3583478625e78a91\" style=\"width:100%;height:390px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-73df3583478625e78a91\">{\"x\":{\"visdat\":{\"82e47c4d7072\":[\"function () \",\"plotlyVisDat\"]},\"cur_data\":\"82e47c4d7072\",\"attrs\":{\"82e47c4d7072\":{\"labels\":[\"Canonical\",\"Novel Cryptic Junction\",\"Alternative Splice Site\",\"Exon Skipping\"],\"values\":[199,52,49,20],\"hole\":0.55000000000000004,\"marker\":{\"colors\":[\"#1F6FB4\",\"#C0392B\",\"#E4A33C\",\"#7FA96B\"],\"line\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"width\":1.5}},\"textinfo\":\"label+percent\",\"textposition\":\"outside\",\"hovertemplate\":\"<b>%{label}<\\/b><br>%{value} events<br>%{percent}<extra><\\/extra>\",\"alpha_stroke\":1,\"sizes\":[10,100],\"spans\":[1,20],\"type\":\"pie\"}},\"layout\":{\"margin\":{\"b\":30,\"l\":10,\"t\":30,\"r\":10},\"showlegend\":false,\"annotations\":[{\"text\":\"320<br>sQTL<br>events\",\"showarrow\":false,\"font\":{\"size\":13}}],\"hovermode\":\"closest\"},\"source\":\"A\",\"config\":{\"modeBarButtonsToAdd\":[\"hoverclosest\",\"hovercompare\"],\"showSendToCloud\":false},\"data\":[{\"labels\":[\"Canonical\",\"Novel Cryptic Junction\",\"Alternative Splice Site\",\"Exon Skipping\"],\"values\":[199,52,49,20],\"hole\":0.55000000000000004,\"marker\":{\"color\":\"rgba(31,119,180,1)\",\"colors\":[\"#1F6FB4\",\"#C0392B\",\"#E4A33C\",\"#7FA96B\"],\"line\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"width\":1.5}},\"textinfo\":\"label+percent\",\"textposition\":[\"outside\",\"outside\",\"outside\",\"outside\"],\"hovertemplate\":[\"<b>%{label}<\\/b><br>%{value} events<br>%{percent}<extra><\\/extra>\",\"<b>%{label}<\\/b><br>%{value} events<br>%{percent}<extra><\\/extra>\",\"<b>%{label}<\\/b><br>%{value} events<br>%{percent}<extra><\\/extra>\",\"<b>%{label}<\\/b><br>%{value} events<br>%{percent}<extra><\\/extra>\"],\"type\":\"pie\",\"frame\":null}],\"highlight\":{\"on\":\"plotly_click\",\"persistent\":false,\"dynamic\":false,\"selectize\":false,\"opacityDim\":0.20000000000000001,\"selected\":{\"opacity\":1},\"debounce\":0},\"shinyEvents\":[\"plotly_hover\",\"plotly_click\",\"plotly_selected\",\"plotly_relayout\",\"plotly_brushed\",\"plotly_brushing\",\"plotly_clickannotation\",\"plotly_doubleclick\",\"plotly_deselect\",\"plotly_afterplot\",\"plotly_sunburstclick\"],\"base_url\":\"https://plot.ly\"},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n*Zoom on the sQTL branch above: splicing event class of every junction that colocalized.*\n\n## How to use it\n\n- **Manhattan (interactive)** — Manhattan plot of the whole genome, hover through a locus to show colocalization details.\n- **Colocalization Explorer** — Full colocalization bubble plot, you can filter by dataset family and locus.\n- **Development vs Adult** — Dev/adult contrast, with highlight to dev-only pairs.\n- **Cell Type Specificity** — cell type specificity heatmap (sceQTL).\n- **Locus Table** — browsable table, with an overview of results by locus.\n\n## A peek at the methodology\n\nThe results shown correspond to Bayesian colocalization (`coloc.abf`, PP.H4 ≥ 0,8) between the consensus AD GWAS (2026) and 23 xQTL datasets — BigBrain (adult, eQTL/sQTL), DevBrain (fetal, eQTL/sQTL), SingleBrain (7 major cell types) e GTEx (15 tissues). Colocalization windows were defined as 500 kb centered at the reported lead variant of each locus. Full methods will be published soon in a paper. Pipeline: [`nf_coloc`](https://github.com/juliaapolonio/nf_coloc).\n",
